 "card": "This PR expands the generateblock RPC to support multiple coinbase recipients with optional custom satoshi allocations, falling back to burning the subsidy in OP_RETURN if no outputs are supplied. It also makes the transactions argument optional, allowing blocks to directly pull from the mempool unless an explicit list or empty array is provided. This simplifies test harness setups and unblocks developers simulating multi-output coinbase distributions like mining pools on regtest.",
